WEBVTT

00:00:08.335 --> 00:00:13.035
. hack//Legend of the Twilight

00:00:15.875 --> 00:00:22.905
Tell me nanimo wakaranai no demo
Tell me I don't
understand anything, but

00:00:23.085 --> 00:00:30.085
You say itsumo sonna kotoba mo
You always say those
kinds of words, too

00:00:31.025 --> 00:00:37.825
Surechigau dake no
You find another way
You find another way where
we only pass each other by

00:00:38.305 --> 00:00:44.935
Owatteku sekai wo tobidashite
You know?
And rush out into a world
that's ending, you know?

00:00:45.245 --> 00:00:50.805
Hello Hello
It's a New World
Hello, hello, it's a New World!

00:00:51.085 --> 00:00:54.515
Hikari yori hayaku
Faster than light,

00:00:55.285 --> 00:00:59.315
monokuro no supiido de
with monochromatic speed

00:00:59.585 --> 00:01:05.155
Hello Hello It's a New World
Hello, hello, it's a New World!

00:01:05.365 --> 00:01:08.885
Jikan yori tooku
Farther than time,

00:01:09.695 --> 00:01:14.465
kakenukeru You're so far away
I run through it; you're so far away

00:01:30.815 --> 00:01:34.755
The Legendary Hero

00:01:48.375 --> 00:01:50.505
Man, they can't be performing...

00:01:50.505 --> 00:01:52.995
...maintenance for
twenty-four hours straight.

00:01:53.445 --> 00:01:56.175
This time the Spring of Myst is empty!

00:01:56.915 --> 00:01:59.815
Who's behind this prank?

00:02:15.865 --> 00:02:17.765
Is there such a monster?

00:02:22.735 --> 00:02:23.895
Upside down palm trees...

00:02:24.105 --> 00:02:27.565
...empty Springs of Myst,
never before seen monsters.

00:02:28.075 --> 00:02:30.545
This is weird! Could they be...

00:02:43.725 --> 00:02:45.625
I'll just log out and
contact the system admi...

00:02:46.795 --> 00:02:48.885
Eh! What's this?!

00:03:18.595 --> 00:03:20.725
I, Shugo Kunisaki...

00:03:21.135 --> 00:03:23.255
...upon entering junior
high, had outgrown games.

00:03:25.965 --> 00:03:27.905
CONGRATULATIONS

00:03:27.905 --> 00:03:29.575
CONGRATULATIONS
I was aware that a net
game called "The World"...

00:03:29.575 --> 00:03:30.235
I was aware that a net
game called "The World"...

00:03:30.235 --> 00:03:31.175
...was popular around the world...

00:03:31.175 --> 00:03:32.275
"The World" Limited Edition
Character Campaign
...was popular around the world...

00:03:32.275 --> 00:03:32.845
"The World" Limited Edition
Character Campaign

00:03:32.845 --> 00:03:34.515
"The World" Limited Edition
Character Campaign
...but I never had the urge to play it.

00:03:34.515 --> 00:03:35.275
"The World" Limited Edition
Character Campaign

00:03:37.075 --> 00:03:39.545
What you get is...

00:03:41.315 --> 00:03:42.445
Until today, that is.

00:03:44.525 --> 00:03:46.115
What? You're kidding me...

00:03:46.225 --> 00:03:47.955
You won too, big brother?

00:03:48.195 --> 00:03:49.815
Won!?

00:03:49.925 --> 00:03:52.685
So you went behind my
back and entered me, Rena?

00:03:53.065 --> 00:03:56.555
But the odds are astronomical...

00:03:56.865 --> 00:03:58.855
...for the two of us to have won!

00:03:58.905 --> 00:04:00.305
We're definitely twins!

00:04:00.905 --> 00:04:04.565
You know, even if I won this...

00:04:04.805 --> 00:04:07.365
I don't have the software
for "The World".

00:04:07.505 --> 00:04:08.605
No problem!

00:04:08.715 --> 00:04:13.345
Before Mother and I left your place,
I installed it on your computer.

00:04:13.845 --> 00:04:14.975
Since we won...

00:04:15.315 --> 00:04:18.685
Let's play "The World" together!

00:04:23.755 --> 00:04:25.755
You're well prepared.

00:04:31.835 --> 00:04:32.665
Let's go.

00:04:57.695 --> 00:05:02.025
The latest net games are so realistic.

00:05:03.395 --> 00:05:04.495
I haven't seen you in a while...

00:05:04.535 --> 00:05:06.465
...and you've suddenly
leveled up so much.

00:05:07.135 --> 00:05:09.005
It's because I'm with a strong party...

00:05:09.075 --> 00:05:11.535
...I've gained experience
with this spear.

00:05:14.005 --> 00:05:17.945
Man! That area's treasure
boxes are mostly trapped!

00:05:19.245 --> 00:05:22.305
Hey, form a party with me?

00:05:29.225 --> 00:05:30.415
Owwww!

00:05:36.235 --> 00:05:38.635
You have some nerve plowing
into my breasts like that.

00:05:39.105 --> 00:05:40.465
Do you want to...

00:05:41.775 --> 00:05:43.735
...to try it again?

00:05:44.745 --> 00:05:45.865
Yeah, right.

00:05:48.215 --> 00:05:52.045
I might just get to like "The World".

00:05:52.645 --> 00:05:54.445
Shugo, you're late!

00:06:00.825 --> 00:06:02.485
You're my older brother Shugo, right?

00:06:03.525 --> 00:06:05.155
C-Could you be...

00:06:05.425 --> 00:06:09.555
Rena? My little twin sister... Rena?

00:06:10.235 --> 00:06:13.865
Bingo! It's been a while, big brother.

00:06:14.065 --> 00:06:17.065
Well, it's the first time
meeting in this form.

00:06:17.875 --> 00:06:21.275
I'm Rena the Heavy Blade!
Pleased to meet you.

00:06:24.245 --> 00:06:24.905
Thanks.

00:06:25.485 --> 00:06:27.975
Those guys. Aren't they the ones?

00:06:28.315 --> 00:06:30.875
You mean?
The limited edition player characters?

00:06:30.955 --> 00:06:32.715
You're kidding, they're the winners?

00:06:34.925 --> 00:06:36.225
Are you sure?

00:06:36.655 --> 00:06:37.785
Think so?

00:06:37.855 --> 00:06:40.085
Well they're not commonly
seen player characters.

00:06:40.695 --> 00:06:42.725
It looks like we've been noticed.

00:06:43.165 --> 00:06:44.295
Of course.

00:06:44.805 --> 00:06:47.565
We're the winners of the
Character Campaign.

00:06:47.835 --> 00:06:48.495
I never thought...

00:06:48.635 --> 00:06:51.505
...that the dot hackers characters...

00:06:51.675 --> 00:06:52.975
...would be the present.

00:06:53.775 --> 00:06:55.205
Dot Hackers?

00:06:56.045 --> 00:06:56.975
They're the only party...

00:06:57.175 --> 00:07:02.245
...to have cleared the last
mystery of "The World".

00:07:03.215 --> 00:07:04.815
There were 2 original members...

00:07:05.455 --> 00:07:07.445
...a young male Twin Blade, Kite and...

00:07:07.655 --> 00:07:09.885
...a young girl Heavy Blade, BlackRose.

00:07:10.595 --> 00:07:12.155
When they solved the mystery...

00:07:12.325 --> 00:07:15.665
...people were no longer
allowed to use these characters.

00:07:16.335 --> 00:07:19.595
To be able to use legendary
heroes... it's the BEST!!

00:07:20.205 --> 00:07:22.195
Legendary heroes?

00:07:28.975 --> 00:07:29.905
What's wrong?

00:07:30.645 --> 00:07:32.545
T- that... look of yours...

00:07:33.045 --> 00:07:35.515
Can't you do something about it?

00:07:36.815 --> 00:07:41.155
I mean, can't you look
more like a legendary hero?

00:07:42.155 --> 00:07:43.315
I don't know.

00:07:43.355 --> 00:07:45.845
Personally, I think I'm very cute.

00:07:47.465 --> 00:07:50.325
Even if it's just a game.
It's making your brother sad.

00:07:50.395 --> 00:07:52.395
No need to make such a fuss about it.

00:07:55.005 --> 00:07:56.335
I've found you!

00:08:03.645 --> 00:08:04.775
Um...

00:08:06.545 --> 00:08:10.075
W-Would you do business with me?

00:08:10.555 --> 00:08:12.715
To suddenly ask to do business...

00:08:13.555 --> 00:08:15.255
M-My mistake.

00:08:15.425 --> 00:08:19.585
Um... Troop? Lover? Crew?

00:08:22.495 --> 00:08:26.365
Um... Um... Um...!

00:08:26.905 --> 00:08:29.705
Calm down. I'll...

00:08:30.435 --> 00:08:32.775
This feels so strange.

00:08:33.105 --> 00:08:35.165
To be talking with you, Rena.

00:08:35.715 --> 00:08:38.075
Three months after you left.

00:08:39.115 --> 00:08:41.585
Have you been eating right?

00:08:41.685 --> 00:08:43.915
Eh? I'm fine.

00:08:44.115 --> 00:08:46.815
I've gotten pretty good at cooking.

00:08:48.595 --> 00:08:49.885
What about you?

00:08:50.025 --> 00:08:52.015
Is mom busy with work?

00:08:52.725 --> 00:08:54.715
Yes... No problems.

00:08:55.195 --> 00:08:56.325
I see.

00:08:56.795 --> 00:08:57.455
Well.

00:08:57.965 --> 00:08:59.595
Since we're logged in...

00:09:00.065 --> 00:09:01.035
...why don't we go somewhere?

00:09:03.275 --> 00:09:06.465
But it's kind of fun this way, too...

00:09:06.675 --> 00:09:08.105
Eh? What?

00:09:08.745 --> 00:09:09.865
It's nothing.

00:09:10.845 --> 00:09:12.045
Let's go do the very foundation...

00:09:12.385 --> 00:09:14.215
...of roleplaying - fighting monsters!

00:09:14.445 --> 00:09:15.575
Sure.

00:09:20.655 --> 00:09:25.715
Let's go to "Bursting
Passed Over Aqua Field"!

00:09:30.495 --> 00:09:33.225
Bursting Passed Over Aqua Field!

00:09:43.715 --> 00:09:44.835
We're here!

00:09:45.515 --> 00:09:46.645
And the monsters?

00:09:47.185 --> 00:09:49.445
They appear through
the magic portals.

00:09:49.785 --> 00:09:50.645
Magic portals?

00:09:51.185 --> 00:09:52.315
This way. This way.

00:09:52.385 --> 00:09:53.855
H-hey Rena!

00:09:58.425 --> 00:09:59.825
What a low level.

00:10:00.065 --> 00:10:02.625
It's an area designed for newbies.

00:10:06.035 --> 00:10:08.095
Oho... And those two are...

00:10:16.445 --> 00:10:18.005
Here it comes.

00:10:20.615 --> 00:10:23.085
It'll be fine, you don't
need to be nervous!

00:10:23.755 --> 00:10:26.055
It's mostly small fry in this area.

00:10:27.455 --> 00:10:29.185
That's... a monster?

00:10:29.855 --> 00:10:32.625
That's a Mad Grass,
a level one monster.

00:10:33.165 --> 00:10:34.425
Level 1?

00:10:38.265 --> 00:10:39.635
Stand back, Rena.

00:10:40.135 --> 00:10:42.065
I'll protect my adorable little sister.

00:10:42.135 --> 00:10:43.295
Shugo!

00:10:44.905 --> 00:10:46.065
Shugo!

00:10:51.245 --> 00:10:52.805
Calamity Cut!

00:10:57.555 --> 00:10:59.745
The legendary hero is crying.

00:10:59.925 --> 00:11:01.085
Here, take this.

00:11:01.755 --> 00:11:02.595
Whats this?

00:11:02.595 --> 00:11:03.645
It's a health drink.

00:11:03.795 --> 00:11:05.255
It restores your hit points.

00:11:08.665 --> 00:11:11.065
Phew. I feel refreshed.

00:11:11.765 --> 00:11:14.535
Shugo, you don't know
how to attack do you?

00:11:14.535 --> 00:11:15.595
Eh?

00:11:15.735 --> 00:11:19.905
You could have won using a
blade against a Mad Grass.

00:11:20.475 --> 00:11:22.675
You didn't read the
instruction manual, did you?

00:11:23.215 --> 00:11:24.545
And I went through all that trouble.

00:11:26.185 --> 00:11:27.075
Hey, Shugo!

00:11:27.185 --> 00:11:29.275
You say you've graduated
from games but...

00:11:29.555 --> 00:11:32.485
...in reality you don't read
the instruction manual and
play however you want.

00:11:32.525 --> 00:11:33.785
Then you get defeated...

00:11:34.025 --> 00:11:37.385
Then you complain about
the game and stop playing.

00:11:37.755 --> 00:11:40.665
That's not graduating,
it's more like quitting.

00:11:40.795 --> 00:11:42.455
I wouldn't go that far.

00:11:43.095 --> 00:11:45.195
That's fine with those other games.

00:11:46.365 --> 00:11:49.205
But this game, "The World".

00:11:49.605 --> 00:11:52.505
After all, this is where I can see you.

00:11:53.545 --> 00:11:55.065
I'll go read the instruction manual.

00:11:55.915 --> 00:11:59.365
I'll get the next monster.

00:12:04.685 --> 00:12:05.915
This time for sure!

00:12:06.185 --> 00:12:09.085
The legendary hero is resurrected!

00:12:22.975 --> 00:12:25.135
Is this one of those
"small fry" monsters?

00:12:25.545 --> 00:12:28.335
N-no, it's an Armored Super Shogun.

00:12:28.875 --> 00:12:31.645
A level 48 super-strong monster!

00:12:48.965 --> 00:12:51.395
W-What's a Armored Super Shogun...

00:12:51.495 --> 00:12:52.865
...doing in a newbie area?!

00:13:12.225 --> 00:13:13.385
Rena!

00:13:14.625 --> 00:13:16.355
With just a graze?

00:13:16.495 --> 00:13:18.485
You need to heal, Shugo.

00:13:18.565 --> 00:13:19.825
Nevermind that, run!

00:13:19.995 --> 00:13:20.685
But.

00:13:22.535 --> 00:13:23.085
Run!

00:13:29.205 --> 00:13:31.435
Was I finished off?

00:13:32.975 --> 00:13:35.495
Just when I wanted
to show off to Rena.

00:13:35.975 --> 00:13:37.445
That's why games...

00:13:42.155 --> 00:13:43.315
What is this?

00:13:44.015 --> 00:13:46.955
Is "The World" this kind of game?

00:13:51.125 --> 00:13:52.285
Am I going to die?

00:13:54.025 --> 00:13:56.555
I wonder what happens
when you die in this game?

00:13:57.695 --> 00:13:59.225
Well, it's just a game.

00:13:59.405 --> 00:14:01.895
All I have to do is get the
head mount display off.

00:14:12.445 --> 00:14:15.975
W-What? My body won't move!

00:14:16.755 --> 00:14:21.845
Help me! Dad! Mom! Rena!

00:14:26.095 --> 00:14:32.365
Hey Shugo! Where are you, Shugo?

00:15:04.265 --> 00:15:07.965
Shugo! Where are you?

00:15:08.875 --> 00:15:13.505
As long as someone in
the party is still alive...

00:15:13.945 --> 00:15:17.465
...a dead character should
remain nearby as a ghost.

00:15:18.175 --> 00:15:19.545
Why isn't he here?

00:15:19.615 --> 00:15:20.805
Something's wrong!

00:15:24.685 --> 00:15:27.175
Why did such a powerful
monster appear?!

00:15:27.225 --> 00:15:28.655
This is totally different from
the instruction manual!

00:15:48.205 --> 00:15:49.545
You mustn't die.

00:15:50.915 --> 00:15:52.035
Rena?

00:15:54.285 --> 00:15:56.775
No. Who?

00:16:12.765 --> 00:16:14.795
Aaah! T-Thank you.

00:16:15.835 --> 00:16:17.365
You healed me?

00:16:25.485 --> 00:16:26.675
Data Drain.

00:16:26.915 --> 00:16:27.575
Eh?

00:16:29.015 --> 00:16:32.475
You can defeat it if
you use Data Drain.

00:16:33.485 --> 00:16:36.255
Defeat it? You mean that monster?

00:16:38.925 --> 00:16:42.415
The only one who can
save this world... is you.

00:16:43.695 --> 00:16:46.595
The heir to the dot hackers legend.

00:16:47.665 --> 00:16:48.825
H-hey...

00:16:49.835 --> 00:16:50.965
Please.

00:17:07.125 --> 00:17:09.355
I'm alive, right?

00:17:11.925 --> 00:17:13.415
My first kiss?!

00:17:16.835 --> 00:17:17.995
This bracelet...

00:17:18.265 --> 00:17:19.595
No!

00:17:20.165 --> 00:17:21.035
Rena!

00:17:24.405 --> 00:17:25.595
Rena!

00:17:34.115 --> 00:17:36.345
Balmung of the Azure Sky?!

00:17:42.655 --> 00:17:43.785
Why?!

00:17:52.965 --> 00:17:57.965
Rena. Rena! Rena!

00:17:59.275 --> 00:18:00.065
Shugo!

00:18:00.605 --> 00:18:01.935
Stand back!

00:18:02.145 --> 00:18:03.775
You're no match for this one!

00:18:04.345 --> 00:18:05.935
My little sister is in trouble!

00:18:06.015 --> 00:18:07.385
You think I'll stand back?!

00:18:07.385 --> 00:18:08.505
Shugo!

00:18:10.385 --> 00:18:10.975
Rena!

00:18:11.655 --> 00:18:12.645
Shugo!

00:18:14.685 --> 00:18:15.845
Rena!

00:18:18.355 --> 00:18:23.095
I'll protect Rena! Data Drain!

00:18:37.015 --> 00:18:39.875
The Armored Super Shogun
is now a Limp Knife!

00:18:42.015 --> 00:18:43.245
Rena, are you all right?! Huh?

00:18:48.555 --> 00:18:49.715
Are you all right?

00:18:49.895 --> 00:18:52.295
Aah... Yes.

00:18:52.465 --> 00:18:54.295
W-Who are you?!

00:18:54.495 --> 00:18:57.725
Don't hold my sister like that!

00:19:06.575 --> 00:19:09.335
Who was that cool guy?

00:19:14.515 --> 00:19:16.445
Found the Limp Knife.

00:19:16.585 --> 00:19:18.345
Vak Don!!!

00:19:24.625 --> 00:19:26.425
The Rare Hunter of
Love and Courage...

00:19:26.765 --> 00:19:28.755
...Mireille is here!

00:19:29.435 --> 00:19:30.825
Rare Hunter?

00:19:31.135 --> 00:19:34.965
A collector of rare or fine items.

00:19:38.975 --> 00:19:39.835
You're the winners...

00:19:40.075 --> 00:19:42.805
...of the limited edition
characters right?

00:19:42.875 --> 00:19:44.405
Y-Yeah.

00:19:44.645 --> 00:19:45.575
I thought so!

00:19:45.785 --> 00:19:49.015
I thought that was
it, so I followed you!

00:19:50.785 --> 00:19:53.685
Thanks to you, I got to see
some really neat things.

00:19:53.955 --> 00:19:57.015
An Armored Super Shogun
appearing in a newbie area.

00:19:57.325 --> 00:19:59.415
The appearance of
Balmung of the Azure Sky.

00:19:59.495 --> 00:20:03.195
Balmung? That guy was Balmung?

00:20:03.835 --> 00:20:06.495
Yes. He's pretty famous.

00:20:07.605 --> 00:20:10.465
I forgot to thank him.

00:20:11.305 --> 00:20:13.235
You really get some special...

00:20:13.475 --> 00:20:15.705
...events with the limited
edition characters!

00:20:16.315 --> 00:20:20.715
An event? Was that what that was?

00:20:23.355 --> 00:20:26.785
But the biggest
surprise is this bracelet!

00:20:27.155 --> 00:20:29.625
It's the first time I've seen
an item that's able to...

00:20:29.725 --> 00:20:31.125
...rewrite a monster's data.

00:20:31.295 --> 00:20:33.985
Aaaah what a nice texture.

00:20:34.025 --> 00:20:36.395
Oh no! I have to make dinner!

00:20:36.395 --> 00:20:36.835
How nice! How nice!
Oh no! I have to make dinner!

00:20:36.835 --> 00:20:38.025
How nice! How nice!

00:20:38.095 --> 00:20:40.105
I want it, I want it.

00:20:40.105 --> 00:20:41.695
Let's go home.

00:20:44.535 --> 00:20:46.905
Well, bye then!

00:20:47.105 --> 00:20:48.235
Thanks.

00:20:48.605 --> 00:20:50.235
W-Wait a sec!

00:21:00.025 --> 00:21:01.715
You called, Lord Balmung?

00:21:03.195 --> 00:21:05.685
Reki. Just now...

00:21:06.365 --> 00:21:08.155
...an Armored Super Shogun
appeared in this area.

00:21:08.795 --> 00:21:11.355
It couldn't!
This is an area for beginners.

00:21:12.265 --> 00:21:14.065
It was slightly different from...

00:21:14.935 --> 00:21:16.335
...the normal Armored Super Shogun.

00:21:16.735 --> 00:21:17.795
Eh?

00:21:18.005 --> 00:21:20.995
Perhaps... it has something
to do with that incident.

00:21:22.245 --> 00:21:24.835
Understood. I will investigate.

00:21:27.115 --> 00:21:31.415
But, what worries me
more are those two.

00:21:34.085 --> 00:21:35.955
Kite and BlackRose.

00:21:37.125 --> 00:21:39.455
Why have those two
characters appeared?

00:21:50.375 --> 00:21:50.805
Preview

00:21:50.805 --> 00:21:52.945
Preview
I've got information on events.

00:21:52.945 --> 00:21:53.005
Preview

00:21:53.005 --> 00:21:56.745
Preview
You can flower view in the area
"Voluptuous Cherry Maze".

00:21:56.745 --> 00:21:56.975
Preview

00:21:57.015 --> 00:22:00.705
Let's go carrying sweet
dumplings. Right, Shugo?

00:22:00.985 --> 00:22:02.345
Forget the dog!

00:22:02.385 --> 00:22:05.215
Kite's Bracelet

00:22:06.825 --> 00:22:17.255
Hashitteyuku kodomotachi
no hashagu warai koe ni
In the running children's
frolicking voices

00:22:17.635 --> 00:22:25.165
Hikari to kage oikakete mitaku naru
They want to chase
the light and shadows

00:22:28.445 --> 00:22:38.905
Midori no ha ni sukashite
mita ano taiyou no saki ni
Watching the sun shine
between the green leaves,

00:22:39.225 --> 00:22:47.995
Nani ga aru to omotteita no darou
wondering if something is there.

00:22:49.335 --> 00:22:59.535
Emerald Green hana wo
tsunda te no naka kara
From inside the picking hands,
the emerald green flowers

00:22:59.975 --> 00:23:10.475
Sora kaze tsuchi e to
sugata wo kaeteyuku
change their body to the
sky, the wind, the ground.

00:23:10.755 --> 00:23:22.685
Sono utsukushisa ni me wo hiraita
mabayushi sugiru basho de
Laying in that opulent place that
opened my eyes to its beauty,

00:23:22.995 --> 00:23:30.595
Nekoronda sora ni toikaketeru
Asking questions to the sky
